{"id":"physiquement","lemma":"physiquement","pos":"adv","rank":3299,"glosses":["physically"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-physiquement.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-physiquement.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Je pense que c'est physiquement impossible.","en":"I think that's physically impossible.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"impossible"}]},{"text":"Physiquement, les deux hommes sont très différents.","en":"Physically, the two men were very different.","words":[null,{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"two"},{"g":"man","l":"homme"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"different","l":"différent"}]},{"text":"J'étais mentalement et physiquement fatigué.","en":"I was mentally and physically tired.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"mentally"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"tired"}]},{"text":"C'est physiquement impossible.","en":"It's not physically possible.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"impossible"}]},{"text":"Je fus mentalement et physiquement fatiguée.","en":"I was mentally and physically tired.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"mentally"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"tired","l":"fatigué"}]}]}